  "content": [
    {
      "text": "to Antioch … they delivered the epistle, Acts 15:30. wrote … epistle not to company with fornicators, 1 Cor. 5:9. Ye are our epistle written in our hearts, 2 Cor. 3:2. when this epistle is read among you, Col. 4:16. epistle be read unto all the holy brethren, 1 Thes. 5:27. taught, whether by word, or our epistle, 2 Thes. 2:15. if any man obey not our word by this epistle, 2 Thes. 3:14. As also in all his epistles, 2 Pet. 3:16.",
